WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:35.640
The theme of the third round of

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:38.450
the Banquet Cuisine Competition is Battle of Shanghai Crab.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.200
Xiang En whose nickname is Ten Feet of Blue

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.280
won the round by a despicable means.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.710
We lost the competition,

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:47.040
but after being proved to

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:48.110
be the true owner of Seven-Star Knives,

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.770
Lei En completely changed.

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:51.510
Next.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.780
Well, the fourth round of

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:55.910
the Banquet Cuisine Competition

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.320
is finally going to start.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:00.420
Great.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:01.790
We're counting on you.

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:04.490
But who's my opponent?

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:06.910
Right. You guys are still putting on airs.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.560
The four of you.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:09.730
Who is his opponent?

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.210
Don't worry.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:13.720
Our teammate

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:15.600
has been waiting for you for a long time, Liu Maoxing.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:16.980
Wait for me?

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:22.400
Demon of Vengeance Shaoan! Conclusion of Destiny

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.400
Don't you think it's incredible, Mao?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.790
This time the ceiling has been opened.

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:50.730
There are so many gimmicks here.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:55.680
We were both born in Sichuan which is the inland

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:57.540
at the source of the Yangtze River.

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:58.980
A decade has passed.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.790
Today, we met in Shanghai which is

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.880
at the end of the 4-kilometer-long Yangtze River.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.340
It's been a long time, Mao.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:12.230
Shaoan!

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.940
My opponent is Shaoan.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.640
Sister, who's Shaoan?

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.050
He seems to be the eldest student

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.880
of Mao's mother, Chef Pai.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.230
I remember someone told me that

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.350
he's the bad guy who took away

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.580
all the property of Chrysanthemum Tower

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.660
and caused Chef Pai's death from overwork.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.620
After Chef Pai died,

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.530
he was defeated by Mao in the Mystery
Mapo Tofu Confrontation which is the qualification trial

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.940
for the new head chef of the state-owned restaurant
Chrysanthemum Tower

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.410
and he was deprived of the cooking qualification.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.220
Later, he went missing.

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.020
I didn't expect that he has joined the Dark Cooking Society.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.060
He's the young talented chef

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.650
who was born in Sichuan

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.530
and made great achievements in a short time.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.480
I've also heard about him.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.180
Therefore, this competition

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.550
can be said to be destined.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:03.710
Shaoan,

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.810
why did you join the Dark Cooking Society?

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.260
Why would you ask me?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.800
After you defeated me in that competition,

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.600
I lost everything.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:12.570
Do you think there is still a place

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.790
in this world for me to stay?

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.080
At that time,

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:17.430
only the Dark Cooking Society

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.640
with the waving Blackcloud Qilin flag

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.860
gave me a hand.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:22.980
Besides, I've already

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.020
discovered my long-awaited dream here.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.940
A dream in the Dark Cooking Society?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.010
It's been a long time.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.390
Let me tell you about

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.950
the meaning of the second competition with me

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.040
who has already joined the Dark Cooking Society.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.090
Father.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.810
Is he Shan Lin who's the head chef of Longzhen Restaurant?

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:53.980
This competition

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.200
is not just related to the legendary cookware.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.100
Even the life of Shan Lin who's the head of

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.660
Shanghai Cooking Society is also a bet.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.320
That means

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.370
everything depends on your performance.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.470
Crap.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:06.860
You use my father's life to threaten us.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.720
Use food to control people.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.090
The Dark Cooking Society believes in it.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.590
And I truly resonate with it.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.580
I took the initiative to request

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.110
the invasion of Shanghai.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:20.400
If I lose the competition again,

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.010
I'll lose everything again.

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:29.000
As long as I win and Shan Lin dies,

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.620
I can gain control of

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.230
Shanghai Cooking Society

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.420
and maintain my status in the Dark Cooking Society.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:35.840
Besides,

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:37.260
I can see you feel guilty,

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.690
sad and desperate

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.290
if the head chef of Longzhen Restaurant

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.050
who is also your friend's father

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.940
dies because of

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.320
your bad cooking skills.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:47.990
Defeat you

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.800
and embarrass you in front of everyone.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:53.120
This is the starting point of my glorious dream.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.170
What kind of dream's starting point is it?

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.330
You...

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:01.180
I can't believe that you hold Sanjie's father hostage

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.480
for a boring reason like that.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:03.680
Father!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:05.890
Father.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.850
Father, open the door. Father!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.490
Why are you always like this?

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:16.310
Why?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.400
Why do you always want to achieve your ambition

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.070
by means of cooking?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:21.730
Shaoan!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.320
Stop saying those high-sounding words!

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:27.640
Mao!

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:28.500
Mao!

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.200
I have the first-class cooking skills,

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.700
but Chef Pai

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.580
never praised me as a good chef.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.780
I didn't expect that I was deprived of

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:43.100
the qualification for cooking because of her son.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.440
How can you understand

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:45.900
the humiliation I suffered

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.650
and my bitter experience?

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:48.970
This is all your mother

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.020
Chef Pai's fault.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.690
I'm gonna let you pay for

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:55.970
the physical and mental suffering I got.

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.460
Today I'll not only fulfill my dream

00:06:58.630 --> 00:06:59.720
but also send you to

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:02.460
the painful purgatory for losers.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:03.630
Stop!

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.300
You just can't accept the truth!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.740
Badass, what do you want to do?

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:07.940
I'm gonna kill you!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:08.890
Evil!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:13.510
Mao!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.030
Mao.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:36.740
What a horrible scar!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.550
That scar

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.950
is identical to the scar
on the face of the masked chef Li Yan.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.620
The incredibly strict training of the Dark Cooking Society

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.120
has left him with this scar.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:50.560
Judges,

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.200
all of you are from Shanghai

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.540
like Sanjie's father, right?

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:55.220
Then why do you allow

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:57.440
people of the Dark Cooking Society to

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.960
act in such a bold and evil manner?

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.340
Listen, kid.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.360
In Shanghai,

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.920
powerful people are representatives of justice.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.680
Yes.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.130
And cooking has nothing to do with the justice.

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:14.360
In a word, we'll review the dishes fairly.

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:15.500
What did you say?

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:16.300
Stop talking.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:17.550
Start the competition now.

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:18.770
We're here to

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:19.790
watch the cooking competition.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:20.960
Hurry up!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:23.820
Crap.

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:25.740
You've got it, right?

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:26.980
We're different from you.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.500
Standing here alive is already difficult for people of

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.640
Dark Cooking Society.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.910
Now we're going to announce the ingredients of
the fourth round.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.070
Shut up.

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.570
Listen, about your physical suffering,

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.300
the pain I felt when I lost my mother

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.670
and every other thing

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:48.660
happened between us in the past,

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.380
let's end them today.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.170
But as long as I wear this badge,

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:54.790
I want to tell you that

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:56.290
this competition

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.160
(Super)

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.810
will not be the starting point of your dream.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:07.730
Shanghai, which is at the end of the Yangtze River,

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.960
will be the destination of your ugly dream!

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:16.470
Mao.

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:17.390
Mao.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:19.790
Mao.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.750
You brat.

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.610
There is only one ingredient

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.830
which can end

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:25.740
whatever happened between us.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.260
You mean the stuff which caused trouble

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.250
in the competition of Chrysanthemum Tower, right?

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.160
Yes. It's

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:33.390
tofu!

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.820
(Tofu)

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.230
Tofu?

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.130
The loser's qualification for cooking

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.740
will be canceled permanently by our country.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.800
That cooking competition held in the state-owned restaurant

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.900
Chrysanthemum Tower

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.420
has such an unreasonable rule.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.820
Provincial Military Commander Li was the judge at that time.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.780
The theme proposed by him is...

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:53.380
He wanted us to

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:55.360
reproduce my mother's

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.240
Mystery Mapo Tofu.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:57.580
No problem.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.290
It's very suitable to

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:03.210
choose tofu to be the theme of

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:03.830
our second competition.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.860
The theme is tofu?

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.790
Since this cooking competition

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.620
has already entered the last round which is the climax,

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.890
using the ready-made tofu will be

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:13.940
a buzzkill.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:15.450
You'd better

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.940
start from making tofu with soybeans.

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:18.630
What do you think?

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.310
Besides, we've already eaten so many things.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:22.600
We feel bloated.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.230
Let us take a rest.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:27.230
The handmade tofu is interesting.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.180
I'm OK with this.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:29.990
I'm also OK.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.600
OK. It's settled.

00:10:36.390 --> 00:10:38.150
It's 11:00 p.m. now.

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.310
It'll take you about eleven hours

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.840
to soak soybeans and make tofu.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:44.910
And it'll take you about five hours

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.810
to turn it into a dish.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:48.100
That means we'll

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:50.800
review your dishes sixteen hours later.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.360
That is 3:00 p.m. tomorrow.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.110
Remember, don't be late.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.270
We will not wait any second.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.900
The competition of Mao and Shaoan.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.680
The last round can be said to be
an exciting tofu confrontation.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.260
I can't wait!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:06.830
There are two small kitchens of the bow
and the stern respectively.

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.060
You can prepare your dishes

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.190
in the two kitchens respectively.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.760
Well, the theme of the decisive round

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.880
of the Banquet Cuisine Competition

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.650
has been settled yet.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.140
Mao and Shaoan.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.420
They will

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:20.500
use tofu which is closely related to them

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:21.310
to compete against each other.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:25.000
You'll be thoroughly discredited at the end of

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.630
the Yangtze River.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:27.520
Really?

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.280
I don't think so, Shaoan.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.950
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.590
Lei En, do you think Mao will win this time?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:11.820
Shaoan who lost the tofu competition

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.380
in the past

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:14.560
faces a competition

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.240
whose theme is tofu again this time.

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:18.170
If we don't think too much,

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.860
I think the theme is advantageous to us.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.250
No, it's not that simple.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:23.960
Shaoan has not only been through

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.870
the cruel training of Dark Cooking Society

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:29.070
but also made great achievements

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:30.940
in a short time. It's because

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.410
he has infinite ambitions and hatred for Mao.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:36.830
The stronger the evil thoughts' obsession with him,

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:38.580
the greater the incredible power

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:39.980
motivated by the skills he learned

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.500
in the Dark Cooking Society can be.

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:44.350
It's the most horrible thing about

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:45.670
chefs of Dark Cooking Society.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:48.040
Then only this is certain now.

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:49.960
The legendary cookware,

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.790
the right to control Shanghai Cooking Society

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.780
and the life of Sanjie's father

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.400
all depend on Mao's

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.050
tofu dish.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:12:59.420
Father.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.080
Don't worry, Sanjie.

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.900
You should trust Mao.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.240
Am I right, Mao?

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.450
Yes. Don't worry.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.160
I'll make an unprecedentedly

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:11.590
amazing tofu dish which can be considered as eye-opener.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:14.730
But Mao, it'll take you a long time to

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:15.610
turn soybeans

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.570
into tofu, right?

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:18.720
Can you finish it?

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.370
No problem, Silang.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.950
It's just after 11:00 p.m. Am I right?

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:25.070
To make tofu, the first and the most important thing

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.870
is to choose good soybeans.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.610
Then we need to wash them like that.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.730
Wash them for an hour at least.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:31.930
For an hour?

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.610
Yes. Next, soak soybeans in water

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.490
for one night.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:37.250
Let them absorb water completely.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.700
This step

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:40.270
will probably end at 9:00 a.m.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.130
tomorrow.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.490
Later, grind the soft soybeans,

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:44.360
boil them

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.050
and filter them.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:48.420
Separate the soy milk and the soy pulp.

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:49.830
It's almost the time

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.280
to add bittern to the soy milk.

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:55.290
Bittern? What is it?

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:56.340
I know it.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.300
It can be used as a coagulant to

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.200
make the soy milk coagulate, right?

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:01.200
Yes.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.430
After I add the bittern to the soy milk,

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:05.370
the soy milk will become a soft semisolid.

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:07.420
It's the semi-finished tofu.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:09.950
It'll be about 10:00 a.m. by then.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.670
It's very delicious.

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:13.320
It can melt in your mouth

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.040
It's mild

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:15.840
and it has a silky texture.

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:18.280
Then put the semi-finished tofu

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:18.950
into the mold.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.390
And put something heavy above it for a period of time.

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:23.260
Take the tofu

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.480
out of the mold

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.110
gently in water.

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:26.160
I'm done.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.330
When it comes to the light aroma of soybeans

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.880
and the sweetness of fresh tofu,

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:31.770
it's really...

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:33.880
I almost can't stand it.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:34.830
My saliva...

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.220
They'll taste it

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.670
three to four hours later.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.980
Then we'll have enough time to turn it into a dish.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.710
I'm not worried anymore.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:44.780
Well,

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:48.180
I've washed soybeans first.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.600
It's a tiring job actually

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.450
because soybeans are very fragile.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:53.140
It's easy to damage them.

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.180
It's not good if they're polluted because of that.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.470
You're tired.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.180
Do you want to take a rest?

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:03.960
When soybeans are soaked in water,

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:05.210
we can leave them alone, right?

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:06.820
Yes.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:07.640
But...

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.590
Leave them alone, Mao.

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.160
To defeat

00:15:11.210 --> 00:15:11.820
that

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:12.510
bastard,

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:14.250
you'd better take a break

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:15.250
and save your strength.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:16.980
They told me about that.

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:17.920
Shaoan

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.290
is really a hateful man.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:21.840
He beat you so hard.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.560
I'm fine, Meili.

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:24.410
Anyway,

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:25.120
you must

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:27.380
teach him a lesson for us, Mao.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:29.830
I will never let him defeat me.

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:31.700
Because this is also

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:32.850
a competition against myself.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.010
Mao.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:37.890
Because Shaoan

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.580
is a genius in Sichuan cuisine.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.800
My mother

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.350
who was called Fairy of Sichuan
tried her best to train him.

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:44.930
Competing with him

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.490
is like competing with my mother.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:49.700
Surpassing my mother is always

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:50.920
my ultimate goal.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.620
During the competition of Chrysanthemum Tower,

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.060
I was not mature enough.

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.170
It can be said that I was a little bit lucky to win.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.150
This time I must end it.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.680
So you really should take a good rest.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:04.980
If you don't get enough sleep,

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.590
the tongue that you've always been proud of
will be insensitive.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.210
I'll watch those soybeans for you.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:11.270
Don't worry. Go to sleep.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.170
Thank you, Silang.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.550
Well, thank you, all the contestants.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.650
Go to sleep now.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.210
Of course it's good that we can go to sleep.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.690
But can you stay here alone, Silang?

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:22.360
Don't look down on me.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.040
You can count on me.

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.310
Have a sound sleep, Chef Xie.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.970
But I'm still worried.

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.260
Thank you, Silang and Meili.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:34.920
We'll handle it.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.520
Have a sound sleep, Mao.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.810
Shaoan,

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.570
that kid

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.410
took the initiative to decide
the theme of this competition.

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:46.880
Could it be that he already has a plan?

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:48.980
Don't worry.

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:50.910
I'm satisfied with that.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.990
The tofu dish has been very familiar to me

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.600
since I was in Sichuan.

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:56.720
Now I've already

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:58.490
gone through the training of Dark Cooking Society.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.500
I'm more competent than before. Mao,

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.070
I must defeat you tomorrow.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.980
I'll use the solemn tofu trio which is the essence

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.140
of Sichuan Banquet Cuisine

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.740
to defeat him.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.630
It looks like you're the person

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.800
who already has a plan, Shaoan.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:19.500
But better safe than sorry.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.180
Sister,

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:28.310
I don't know Mao

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:30.670
will make what kind of tofu dish.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:31.690
Right.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.980
After all, he's Mao.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:35.830
I'm looking forward to tomorrow's competition.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.540
Mao must be

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.010
thinking about the dish in his dream now.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.440
What's up, sister?

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:46.670
I feel like

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.960
something stabbed me in here just now.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:50.520
Maybe there are something like mosquitoes here.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.270
I've also been stabbed.

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.120
There are really mosquitoes here.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:58.080
Oh, sister.

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.200
Why did you fall asleep suddenly?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:02.860
You can't sleep.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:07.250
It seems that I also feel sleepy.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:31.270
What happened, Meili?

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:32.790
What's that smell?

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:33.930
And there is the heat.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.610
Why does the stove...

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:38.820
It's so stinky.

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.560
My nose is going to break.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:42.450
Why is there a rotten smell?

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:43.800
We

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:44.950
fell asleep unconsciously.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:45.900
After we woke up,

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.410
we found that there is a weird smell in the pot.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.510
The soybeans changed like that.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.940
What? How did that happen?

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:54.690
Why did them become so disgusting?

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.030
This... This is...

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:00.130
Why did them become like that?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.680
How did the soybeans become like that?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:03.420
Silang!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.620
Did you fiddle them?

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:07.860
I did nothing.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.090
Wait!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.800
They're natto!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.390
Natto?

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.790
It's the Japanese natto that Silang's mother

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.150
ever mentioned.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.320
What's wrong?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.320
Crap. It's a setup.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.160
What's the thing in your hand?

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.850
It's the straw.

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:32.010
There are many hay bacilli

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.850
which is needed for making the natto on the straw.

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:37.340
Someone put the straw in the soybeans on purpose.

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:40.300
Besides, in order to speed up
the reproduction of the natto,

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:41.970
he built a fire for the stove.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.640
Was there anything wrong last night,

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:45.240
Silang?

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:46.840
I remember

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:48.390
that we

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:51.080
both fell asleep after mosquitoes stung us.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:51.740
What?

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:55.550
Mosquitoes didn't sting you.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.660
You were stabbed by needles.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:58.800
You were stabbed by poisonous needles which were covered

00:19:58.850 --> 00:19:59.800
by hypnotics.

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:01.740
Someone of Dark Cooking Society did that.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:02.700
Dark?

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:04.160
It must be Xiang En.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:07.420
Only she would do something like that.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.540
Crap.

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:10.590
How despicable

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.020
the Dark Cooking Society can be?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.250
It's our fault. We failed to protect the soybeans.

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:15.320
Otherwise, it wouldn't happen.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.780
Sorry. I didn't mean it.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.100
You idiot!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.170
It's useless to say sorry!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:21.630
Someone patted his chest

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:22.770
and said we can count on him, right?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.560
Which arrogant

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.060
idiot said that?

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.720
Help, Mao!

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:33.210
It's 5:00 a.m.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.080
In other words, the review will start ten hours later.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:37.400
Even if we start to make tofu again now,

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.000
the time is just enough.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:39.870
That means

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.440
we'll have no time to make a dish.

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:42.490
Why?

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.270
Those soybeans cannot be used.

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:46.420
What should we do, Mao?

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:52.120
Even Mao can't think a way out.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.730
Please find a way, Mao.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.320
My father's life is in your hands now.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:58.580
Mao.

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:02.960
Sorry, Mao.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:04.100
Sorry.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:11.610
Mao.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.380
Mao.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:16.230
No. Thank you.

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.400
Luckily, I slept.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.070
Now I'm completely clear-headed.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.980
We're pressed for time as we have to make tofu.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.490
It's really

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.010
a blessing in disguise.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:30.790
Sanjie,

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:33.550
I believe I can save your father.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:35.710
Are you serious?

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:37.050
Have you found a way?

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.390
Yes, Sanjie.

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:42.070
Xiang En, thank you

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:43.680
for helping me make this

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:44.530
trans-century tofu dish.

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:45.920
What's up?

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.797 --> 00:23:22.118
My chef's spirit exploded in response to
the cowardly ways of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:23:22.576 --> 00:23:26.671
Come on, I'm going to make you guys
some amazing dishes that will blow your minds.

00:23:27.322 --> 00:23:29.057
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.177 --> 00:23:32.238
Mao's Real Ability! Magical Panda Tofu

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.664
It will definitely be interesting!
